; From (wait) a step stays at (wait) or wakes.  (wait) is the least successor,
; so the canonical run, which always takes the least, waits for ever: a cycle
; at its first step.  observe_run_rotating_wakes.tcalc runs this program under
; the rotating schedule.
(step one)
(observe run)
(wait)
(rule stay (take (wait)) (make (wait)))
(rule wake (take (wait)) (make (wake)))
